+| XMTAIL | NMOS | NTAIL | VBIAS | VSS | VSS | {WBIAS} | {LBIAS} | {2*M1_FACTOR} |
+| XMN_INN | NMOS | N1 | VINN | NTAIL | VSS | {WIN} | {LIN} | {M1_FACTOR} |
+| XMN_INP | NMOS | OTA_OUT | VINP | NTAIL | VSS | {WIN} | {LIN} | {M1_FACTOR} |
+| XMP_DIODE | PMOS | N1 | N1 | VDD | VDD | {WLOAD} | {LLOAD} | {M1_FACTOR} |
+| XMP_MIRROR | PMOS | OTA_OUT | N1 | VDD | VDD | {WLOAD} | {LLOAD} | {M1_FACTOR} |
+| XMP_STAGE2 | PMOS | VOUT | OTA_OUT | VDD | VDD | {W2P} | {L2P} | {(2*M1_FACTOR)*M2_FACTOR} |
+| XMN_STAGE2 | NMOS | VOUT | VBIAS | VSS | VSS | {WBIAS} | {LBIAS} | {(2*M1_FACTOR)*M2_FACTOR} |
